{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_st_15-01","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":211,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_st_15-01","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-1","storyName":"过去与现在的终点","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"战争结束前的最后时刻，坚强的无名卡特斯感染者行走在战场上，试图挽救更多的人，并最终走向崩解的结局。特雷西斯进入了源石内化宇宙。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_st_15-01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"st_15-01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"next":1,"characters":["疲惫的伤员","坚强的感染者","恐惧的孩子","满脸厌恶的孩子","沉默的孩子","兴奋的军人","整合运动成员","主教","阿米娅","特雷西斯"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_bg_white.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"sticker","id":9,"text":"<color=#000000>“宇宙”。</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":10,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"sticker","id":12,"text":"<color=#000000>我们应当如何解释这个词语？数学，物理，信仰，空想——</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":13,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":14},{"type":"sticker","id":15,"text":"<color=#000000>我们穷尽思维，试图用不同的语言模型描述这个依旧陌生的词语，并傲慢地宣称我们掌握了绝对正确的“知识”。</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":16,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"sticker","id":18,"text":"<color=#000000>可为何毁灭真正近在咫尺时，大多数人却又缄默不语？</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":19,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":20},{"type":"sticker","id":21,"text":"<color=#000000>知识是不可逆转的。既然我们已从无数谬论中窥到了片面的真理，自然也无法安然退回到无知的黑暗中，漠视终结的降临。</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":22,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":23},{"type":"sticker","id":24,"text":"<color=#000000>我想，也许我已经触碰到解答终极问题的关键——</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":25,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"sticker","id":27,"text":"<color=#000000>用我和你创造的语言，{@nickname}。</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":28,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":29},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":32},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_bg_50_g5_crackedhispdwarship.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":33},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":35},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":36,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":37},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“Dr.{@nickname}，这场战争该结束了。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":38},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“那位德拉克点燃城墙的紫火极大地推动了战争的进程。当典范军和公爵联军的队伍推进至孽茨雷最后的阵地前时——”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":39},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我们停下这场战争的目的也终于触手可及。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":40},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“可......凯尔希医生，最后这短短的一段路还得花上多少时间？”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":41},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“没人能保证，阿米娅。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":42},{"type":"subtitle","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"animtext","id":46,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>伦蒂尼姆外围战场，“荣光”号残骸</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":47},{"type":"animtextclean","id":48},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_423_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"源石......","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"这些该死的源石真的斩断了这艘旗舰。我必须留在这里，加入这里的驻军继续战斗......","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"抱歉，我不能继续陪你往前走了，孩子。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"我们一路过来，只有废墟和那些死去的......我没有看到任何驻军。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"还有，请不要叫我孩子！修道院的大伙已经为我的成年庆祝过了——","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"哈哈，你的脾气还真像我的女儿。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"看到那边高处还闪着光芒的地方了吗？那是开斯特公爵阁下的“荣光”号的一部分。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"那门舰炮还在运作，说明我从广播里接收到的通讯是真的。我原先的队伍既然隶属开斯特公爵阁下，现在自然该归队了。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"可你的伤势......","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"有你帮忙治疗，我已经能走动路了。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"倒是你，你确定要继续往城里走吗？那是污染最严重的地方，活性源石环境会害死你的。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"主教爷爷说过，那位从矿场救下我的好心人为了送我回修道院，也吃了很多的苦，走过很多的路。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"救赎从来不是毫无代价的，我很早就清楚。","id":74},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"不用担心我，修士们教会了我很多避开危险的办法。","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"在我走到终点之前，只要能再多救一个人，任何一个人......","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"说实话，我从来没有见过有哪一位修道院里的修士像你这样虔诚......谢谢你，维多利亚以你的善良为荣。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"主教爷爷说，信仰并不是为了一己的荣誉......怀有信仰的人，是虔诚地相信，善举会将这片大地变得更好......","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"变得更好吗......哈，或许吧。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"但无论如何，谢谢你，小兔子，为你做的一切。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"能最后帮我一个忙吗，孩子？如果你回到了城里，我的家还在，我的女儿......也还在......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"疲惫的伤员","text":"麻烦告诉她，爸爸一直在保护着她。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_423_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","focus":"all","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","power":"10","times":"1","duration":"0.2","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"0.6","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"维多利亚军人努力抬起受伤的手臂，向卡特斯敬了一个不甚标准的军礼，然后坦然地转身走向远处军舰的残骸，消失在源石的丛林里。","id":94},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯望着远处舰炮上那抹淡淡的金光，不由得叹了一口气。","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":99},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":100},{"type":"text","text":"远处炮火正响，小小的卡特斯继续向着天际线上的那座城市——伦蒂尼姆进发。","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":104},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_bg_32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我也能听到炮击的声音了，Dr.{@nickname}，凯瑟琳女士的‘爬行号’已经在冲击食腐者的阵地。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":109},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“可击败了食腐者就能结束战争吗？还有那些被波及的无辜者......他们该怎么办？”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":110},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“我们没法在战争中救下每一个人，阿米娅。我们能做的，只有帮助伦蒂尼姆人更快地结束这场灾难。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":111},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“那就意味着，食腐者并非是我们最后的难题。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":112},{"type":"subtitle","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"animtext","id":116,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>伦蒂尼姆无名避难所</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":117},{"type":"animtextclean","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"玛丽，戴维，请不要把这孩子藏在这里的事情告诉其他人。","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"我在城墙下遇到了他，他已经没有其他地方能去。他的父母都是伦蒂尼姆人，他说，很久以前你们在公园里见过面，不是吗？","id":123},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.3","scale":"0.85","duration":"0","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的孩子","text":"......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1456_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满脸厌恶的孩子","text":"我不记得了。但你帮了我们，我答应帮你忙。是帮你，不是帮他！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_240","duration":"1","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的孩子","text":"......","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"charslot","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.3","scale":"0.85","duration":"0","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","focus":"m","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"80,0","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"谢谢你们。他只会躲在这，不会乱跑，也不会出声。我保证他不会吓到任何人。","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的孩子","text":"（快速地点头）","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1456_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"我很快就回来，我答应了一个人，要找到他的女儿。","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"我没法在外面保护你，外面街道上到处都是充满敌意的人——","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"抱歉，我也找不到更好的地方暂时安置你。至少，这里许多人都接受过我的帮助，我相信这些孩子。","id":154},{"type":"dialog","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"80,0","posto":"30,0","duration":"0.5","id":157},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"小萨卡兹紧紧拽住了卡特斯的手臂，却摸到了那些尖锐的源石结晶。","id":159},{"type":"dialog","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"80,0","duration":"0.3","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"他下意识地缩回了手。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的孩子","text":"（小声）对，对不起！我和爸爸妈妈在一起的时候......很少接触感染者。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1456_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"......我会回来找你的。","id":167},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1456_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的孩子","text":"......","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_1456_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"charslot","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.9","duration":"0","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"l","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满脸厌恶的孩子","text":"......","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_240","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的孩子","text":"......","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":182},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"cg","duration":"0","from":"0.5","to":"0.5","id":187},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_cg_smoke.png","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","id":188},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"60","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":192},{"type":"subtitle","text":"卡特斯离开的时间并不长。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":193},{"type":"subtitle","text":"当她按照地址找到军人的家时，那里已经什么都不剩了。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":194},{"type":"subtitle","text":"但从废墟中找到的信来看，军人的女儿已经加入了城内一支反抗萨卡兹的队伍——“典范军”。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":195},{"type":"subtitle","text":"卡特斯返回避难所的路并不好走，在维多利亚人联合向圣王会西部大堂的萨卡兹阵地进攻时，城内被源石影响的区域仍在不断扩大。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":196},{"type":"subtitle","text":"还有那些四处流窜的狂热萨卡兹佣兵，正仿佛失去了主心骨一般肆意行动。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":197},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她感到头疼，因为城内这糟糕的现状，也因为她身体上那些糟糕的黑色结晶。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":198},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“或许，我也快走到终点了，主教爷爷。”","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":199},{"type":"subtitle","id":200},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":203},{"type":"charslot","id":204},{"type":"image","id":205},{"type":"cg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":206},{"type":"interlude","channel":"2","clear":"true","id":207},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_bg_32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"请问......刚刚是你们在那些佣兵骚扰避难所时保护了这些人吗？","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_409_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的军人","text":"是的。我们这支小队里典范军和公爵联军的士兵都有，准备去圣王会西部大堂阵地时突然收到了求救。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_409_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的军人","text":"请相信，这场混乱马上就会结束了。也感谢您照顾这些孩子和避难的人。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_409_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#7$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"......","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_409_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的军人","text":"欸，您在找什么人吗？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_409_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯摇了摇头。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_409_1#1$1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的军人","text":"对了，我们顺便也清理了一下周围躲着的魔族佬，他们眼看快败了，也想躲起来。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_409_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#7$1","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"——！","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_409_1#1$1","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的军人","text":"再会，我们得赶去前线了。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_409_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","text":"","id":233},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":236},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"charslot","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"......我没看到那个孩子。","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的孩子","text":"......","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满脸厌恶的孩子","text":"......跟我来。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.4","delay":"0.3","channel":"2","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"孩子带着卡特斯穿过工厂层层叠叠的掩体，卡特斯看到避难所的其他人沉默地搬运着萨卡兹的尸体。","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"走到一堆集装箱之前，孩子费力地挪开了凌乱的遮掩。","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"那个蜷缩的萨卡兹孩子惊恐地看着他们。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_661_1#1$1","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满脸厌恶的孩子","text":"她来了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满脸厌恶的孩子","text":"我答应过帮你。刚才事情比较突然，我也没有其他地方能藏他了。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_240","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的孩子","text":"但他不能继续留在这里。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_240.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#1$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"......回来的路上我遇到了一支名叫整合运动的队伍，他们可以收留这个孩子。","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_bg_58_mini01_westlobbysquare.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_729_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":271},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"放心，那个孩子我们会照顾好的——但是你呢？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_729_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"你的感染状况很糟糕......你应该和我们一起走。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_729_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#4$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"我......还有其他的事没有做完。","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_729_1#1$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"好吧，我不会勉强你，你和我认识的很多同伴很像。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_729_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动成员","text":"这些抑制剂和防护装备我留给你了。再见。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_729_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1729_1#2$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"......再见。","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"远处，维多利亚人前仆后继地向食腐者之王最后的阵地走去，生命在消逝。","id":287},{"type":"text","text":"那不是她的战争，她感到恐惧，她也无法理解支撑这些人克服死亡恐惧的力量来源于何处。","id":288},{"type":"text","text":"但她希望救下更多的人，继续麻木地救下更多的人......一个又一个。","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"......哪怕只是徒劳。","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"她想起离开修道院那天，主教与她坐在河畔教堂外的告别。","id":291},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_bg_26_g5_laterano_chapelout.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"你问，何为信仰？","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"呵呵......我年轻游历时曾去过伊比利亚，我亲眼目睹过大静谧下身边人生活的崩溃，但那个顽强的国家却从未彻底屈服。","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"起初，我只是在为那个国家的生命力而赞叹，但随着我活过的岁月越来越久，我才逐渐醒悟......","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"那样的生命力，就是信仰。","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"有谁教育过我，或是其他那些伊比利亚人，我们应该何去何从？有谁曾许诺过，我们一定会跨过那样恐怖的灾难？","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"没有，但我们总会在灾难面前说服我们自己。我们经历的一切总有意义，苦难终有尽头，我们会有一个美好的未来。","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"这就是信仰。","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"信仰不在经文上，也不在祷告词和赞美诗当中，而是在我们的生命中。","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"信仰在我们的身体和思维中，在我们的心脏的每一次律动中，在一呼一吸之中。是我们一切力量的来源。","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"主教","text":"......只因为我们相信。","id":309},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":310},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"主教爷爷。如果真如您所说，一切苦难终归是有尽头的，那个美好的将来，又在何处呢......","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"主教爷爷......我应该，已经尽力了。","id":316},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":318},{"type":"image","image":"60_i21","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","y":"80","x":"-70","id":319},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"80","yTo":"55","duration":"30","id":320},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$storyendjp_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_storyendjp_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":321,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airwaramb","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":324},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯疲惫地倒在废墟中，听到远处传来的炮火声和隐隐的哭喊。","id":326},{"type":"text","text":"剧烈的疼痛提醒着她这副身体已经行至终点的残酷事实。","id":327},{"type":"text","text":"她向周围那些被她从死亡前救下的人招了招手，独自留在远离其他人的空旷处。","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crystal_shatter","id":329},{"type":"text","text":"她的身体开始崩解。","id":330},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚强的感染者","text":"......我愿意去相信......","id":332},{"type":"dialog","id":333},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"卡特斯眼睛所能捕捉到的光越来越黯淡，直至陷入漫长的黑夜。","id":335},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":337},{"type":"charslot","id":338},{"type":"image","image":"60_i21","screenadapt":"coverall","id":339},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"text","text":"然后她看到似乎有人握住了她近乎破碎的手，光线开始重新涌回她的眼睛。","id":341},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":343},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"charslot","id":346},{"type":"image","id":347},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_bg_58_mini01_westlobbysquare.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":351},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$2","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"......！","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":356},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"358","text":"阿米娅，怎么了？"}},"values":[],"id":357},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":358,"end":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#2$2","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我好像听到了，感染者发生崩解的声音......又一次。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我几乎都能远远看见离去的人最后时刻迸发的光芒，距离我们并不远。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这段时间，我们已经见过太多次......","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":365},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"367","text":"走吧。"},"2":{"id":"367","text":"该去结束这一切了。"}},"values":[],"id":366},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":367},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"369","text":"我们去面对特雷西斯。"}},"values":[],"id":368},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":369,"end":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$2","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士，走吧。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"n","id":373},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"375","text":"......"}},"values":[],"id":374},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":375,"end":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$2","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士？","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$2.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"charslot","id":379},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"381","text":"凯尔希，我突然有一个疑问。"}},"values":[],"id":380},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":381},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"383","text":"源石内化宇宙中的静滞......到底意味着什么？"},"2":{"id":"383","text":"我们曾涉足的那个地方，是不是连时间都无法逃脱？"}},"values":[],"id":382},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":383,"end":384},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":384,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":387},{"type":"charslot","id":388},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_58_mini05.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","id":389},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":390},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":391},{"type":"text","text":"信息的浪涌冲击着他，试图将他吞没。","id":392},{"type":"text","text":"但特雷西斯屹立不动。","id":393},{"type":"dialog","id":394},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"3","channel":"bgs","id":395},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"45","block":"false","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"我终于亲眼看到了你创造的伟绩，特蕾西娅。","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"animtext","id":401,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_both","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>源石内化宇宙</><p=2>未知时间</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":402},{"type":"animtextclean","id":403},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":404},{"type":"text","text":"他抬头望向矗立在虚空中的高塔，崩溃的碎屑重新化作无序的信息回归虚空。","id":405},{"type":"text","text":"特雷西斯握住了飘散而下的碎屑，可手中转瞬却又一无所有。","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"你为我打开了这扇门，最后这段路，我会替你走完，特蕾西娅。","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"夺下这枚属于萨卡兹的源石，萨卡兹将第一次拥有自己主宰自己命运的权力。","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"他握紧了手中的剑，冷冷地注视着虚空中那逐渐靠近的巨大菱形。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"随即，他走向了崩溃的塔。他很清楚，他将要面对的存在就在那里。","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"毁灭些什么，来铸造阶梯。特蕾西娅已为他留下了道路。","id":411},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“直至消散也未曾放弃抗争的众魂啊，在源石之中为萨卡兹做了最后一件事——”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":414},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“为所有仍活着的人搏一个有权为平等生存而抗争的未来。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":415},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“大家，向前走吧。”","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":416},{"type":"subtitle","id":417},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"一如过往，你为我指引方向，我的剑会开辟前路。","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特雷西斯","text":"我未曾食言，特蕾西娅——","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":422},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","fadetime":"3","channel":"bgs","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"他走上了阶梯，走向了濒临崩毁的塔之巅。","id":425},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":429},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":430},{"type":"image","id":431},{"type":"charslot","id":432}],"characters":["疲惫的伤员","坚强的感染者","恐惧的孩子","满脸厌恶的孩子","沉默的孩子","兴奋的军人","整合运动成员","主教","阿米娅","特雷西斯"]}